      "walkthrough": [
        "Use the midpoint property for reflection across the line $l$, where $P$ is the midpoint of segment $AD$:\n$$\\vec{OP} = \\dfrac{\\vec{OA} + \\vec{OD}}{2} \\implies \\vec{OD} = 2\\vec{OP} - \\vec{OA}$$",
        "Substitute $\\vec{OP} = \\begin{pmatrix} 4/3 \\\\ 5/3 \\\\ -1/3 \\end{pmatrix}$ and $\\vec{OA} = \\begin{pmatrix} 1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 0 \\end{pmatrix}$:\n$$\\vec{OD} = 2\\begin{pmatrix} 4/3 \\\\ 5/3 \\\\ -1/3 \\end{pmatrix} - \\begin{pmatrix} 1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 0 \\end{pmatrix} = \\begin{pmatrix} 8/3 \\\\ 10/3 \\\\ -2/3 \\end{pmatrix} - \\begin{pmatrix} 1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 0 \\end{pmatrix} = \\begin{pmatrix} \\frac{8}{3} - 1 \\\\ \\frac{10}{3} - 2 \\\\ -\\frac{2}{3} - 0 \\end{pmatrix} = \\begin{pmatrix} \\frac{5}{3} \\\\ \\frac{4}{3} \\\\ -\\frac{2}{3} \\end{pmatrix}$$",
        "State the position vector of the reflection point $D$:\n$$\\vec{OD} = \\dfrac{5}{3}\\mathbf{i} + \\dfrac{4}{3}\\mathbf{j} - \\dfrac{2}{3}\\mathbf{k}$$"
